  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:13.900" end="00:15.500" ttm:agent="v1">Boy, you caught my eyes</p>
      <p begin="00:15.500" end="00:18.820" ttm:agent="v1">분명한 my type 이끌리듯 다가가</p>
      <p begin="00:18.820" end="00:23.020" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gon' make you mine, all mine</p>
      <p begin="00:23.020" end="00:26.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">잊지 못할 night (tonight)</p>
      <p begin="00:26.330" end="00:28.410" ttm:agent="v1">너라는 이유</p>
      <p begin="00:28.410" end="00:31.700" ttm:agent="v1">조금 더 가까이 you and I</p>
      <p begin="00:31.700" end="00:35.090" ttm:agent="v1">네게 눈빛을 보내 with my heart</p>
      <p begin="00:35.090" end="00:39.740" ttm:agent="v1">멈춰버린 것 같은 시간 oh</p>
      <p begin="00:39.740" end="00:42.930" ttm:agent="v1">네게 끌려 sweetest obsession</p>
      <p begin="00:42.930" end="00:46.300" ttm:agent="v1">꿈만 같아 you are my passion</p>
      <p begin="00:46.300" end="00:52.540" ttm:agent="v1">여기 둘의 비밀을 새겨 baby</p>
      <p begin="00:52.540" end="00:54.040" ttm:agent="v1">나란히 별을 세며</p>
      <p begin="00:53.860" end="00:56.340" ttm:agent="v1">Let me show you my heaven</p>
      <p begin="00:56.340" end="00:59.660" ttm:agent="v1">너의 맘을 가득히 채워</p>
      <p begin="00:59.660" end="01:05.700" ttm:agent="v1">생각날 걸 24/7, come with me</p>
      <p begin="01:05.700" end="01:08.290" ttm:agent="v1">You are my sweetest obsession</p>
      <p begin="01:08.290" end="01:11.500" ttm:agent="v1">I-I know you want me 보여줄게 처음 보는 view</p>
      <p begin="01:11.500" end="01:15.140" ttm:agent="v1">모든 상상 너머 환상보다 자극적인 꿈</p>
      <p begin="01:15.140" end="01:18.380" ttm:agent="v1">오래 기다려온 것만 같아 only one for you</p>
      <p begin="01:18.380" end="01:21.220" ttm:agent="v1">Can you handle that? Let's make it last</p>
      <p begin="01:21.220" end="01:22.750" ttm:agent="v1">You and me</p>
      <p begin="01:22.750" end="01:26.190" ttm:agent="v1">속삭여줘 your favorite fantasy</p>
      <p begin="01:26.190" end="01:29.430" ttm:agent="v1">달콤하게 녹아든 니 향기</p>
      <p begin="01:29.430" end="01:34.540" ttm:agent="v1">I know it's real 대체할 수 없이</p>
      <p begin="01:34.540" end="01:38.030" ttm:agent="v1">네게 끌려 sweetest obsession</p>
      <p begin="01:38.030" end="01:41.350" ttm:agent="v1">꿈만 같아 you are my passion</p>
      <p begin="01:41.350" end="01:47.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">여기 둘의 비밀을 새겨 baby (oh-whoa)</p>
      <p begin="01:47.580" end="01:49.080" ttm:agent="v1">나란히 별을 세며</p>
      <p begin="01:48.870" end="01:51.310" ttm:agent="v1">Let me show you my heaven</p>
      <p begin="01:51.310" end="01:54.630" ttm:agent="v1">너의 맘을 가득히 채워</p>
      <p begin="01:54.630" end="02:00.580" ttm:agent="v1">생각날 걸 24/7, come with me</p>
      <p begin="02:00.580" end="02:02.100" ttm:agent="v1">You are my sweetest obsession</p>
      <p begin="02:02.100" end="02:05.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ah-ah, ah-ah, ah (obsession)</p>
